# UI

- Whimsical light-first (+ soft dark); Fredoka + Nunito; tokens only from `packages/ui` theme.
- Mobile-first; screens compose UI primitives — minimize one-off Tailwind in routes.
- **Container queries = web-only.** Cross-platform layout: flex + max-width. No `@container` in pure RN views.
- Tailwind theme / repeated recipes live in `packages/ui`, not copy-pasted across apps.
- UI changes require interactive verify (pointer swipe for play) — see `.cursor/skills/verify-ui`.
